            "review_title": "Review at Chilli Thái",
            "review_text": "Minh T\n4 contributions\n0\nChilli Thai Aeon Mall Binh Tan\nNov 2025 • Family\nAt Chilli Thai – Aeon Mall Bình Tân, the food truly captures the essence of Thai cuisine — vibrant, aromatic and perfectly balanced between sour, spicy, sweet and salty. The Pad Thai was beautifully plated, and the Tom Yum delivered a lively kick without overwhelming the palate. The staff were attentive, courteous and quick to assist — even in the busy mall setting. The modern-yet-cozy ambiance adds to the enjoyment, making it a great spot for both casual dining and special occasions. One minor note: some dishes leaned a little heavier on the richness, so if you prefer lighter flavours you might ask for “less oil”. Overall, a highly recommended Thai dining experience in Bình Tân.\nRead more\nWritten November 11, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
