            "review_text": "Discover06913858429\n3 contributions\n0\nChilli Thai restaurant\nNov 2025 • Family\nI really enjoy the food at Chilli Thai. The dishes are full of rich flavors — a perfect mix of spicy, sour, sweet, and salty, just like authentic Thai cuisine. The ingredients taste fresh, and the presentation always looks nice and appetizing.\n\nMy favorite dish is the Tom Yum soup because it has a strong, delicious aroma and a perfect balance of sour and spicy flavors. The staff are friendly, and the atmosphere is cozy, which makes the dining experience even better.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 11, 2025",
